WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.190
Dawn.

2
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:04.610
A line of monks walks
silently past the houses,

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.680
each one holding a bowl.

4
00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:07.590
They do not knock.

5
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.980
They do not ask for anything.

6
00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.630
They simply stand and wait, in silence.

7
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.840
Each monk eats only what people
choose to place in his bowl.

8
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.090
So why would someone give away everything,

9
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.460
then live on whatever
others choose to give?

10
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.640
In this mission, you'll
trace how the Sangha began,

11
00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.320
with five ascetics in a deer park.

12
00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:34.340
Then you'll learn what Buddhists mean
by going for refuge to the Three Jewels.

13
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: find out why monks and
nuns choose to live on what others give.
